<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Psychic Resistance</ansi> mutation

A crystalline lattice forms in your mind, deflecting magical
intrusion. The barrier makes you harder to reach — in every sense.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced incoming magical damage — mental and magical
  intrusions find little purchase

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced charisma — the psychic barrier walls you off
  from others, making genuine connection difficult

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
